      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The representation is intended for debugging purposes and an approximation to the generated SQL. While it might\nwork in the context of a specific dialect, you should not assume that the <a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a> representation works across\nmultiple databases.",
      "translation": "该表示形式旨在用于调试目的，并作为生成的 SQL 的近似值。虽然它可能在特定方言的上下文中有效，但您不应假设<a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a>表示形式可在多个数据库之间通用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Equality is typically given if the <a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a> representation matches.",
      "translation": "当 `<a href=\"Segment.html#toString()\"><code>Segment.toString()</code></a>` 的表示形式匹配时，通常认为相等。",
      "count": 1
